            "texttype":"Online",
            "textpurpose":"Provenance",
            "textentryhtml":"<p>\n\tJanuary 10, 1978, Alphonse Jax, New York, sold to the Princeton University Art Museum [1].\n</p>\n<p>\n\tNotes:\n\t<br />\n\t[1] According to a Jax invoice in the curatorial file.\n</p>",
            "remarks":null
